# Renfit React Patterns

Source of truth for design intent: `frontend/rules/DESIGN.md` and `frontend/rules/README.md`.

## Stack and structure

- **Vite + React 18** with functional components only.
- **Routing**: client-side via `NavigationContext` in `frontend/src/app/App.tsx` — not React Router.
- **Pages**: `frontend/src/app/pages/` (`LandingPage`, `AIChatPage`, `BookingPage`, `DashboardPage`).
- **Landing sections**: `frontend/src/app/components/`.
- **Shared UI primitives**: `frontend/src/app/components/ui/` (shadcn-style). Prefer extending these over one-off markup.
- **Navigation**: use `Link` from `frontend/src/app/components/Link.tsx` with `to` typed as `'/' | '/ai-coach' | '/booking' | '/dashboard'`.
- **Icons**: `lucide-react` only; keep icon color aligned with adjacent text (`text-[#0F6B3E]` on green accents).

## Imports and TypeScript

```tsx
import React from 'react';
import { useState } from 'react';
```

- Add `import React from 'react'` in `.tsx` files when the IDE/TS checker reports the UMD global error.
- Use named exports for components: `export function Hero() { ... }`.
- Colocate page-only mock data inside the page file; extract to `hooks/` or `lib/` when reused twice or wired to APIs.

## App shell

- Root wrapper uses `min-h-screen bg-[#0B0B0B]` — never switch landing or app pages to light backgrounds.
- New routes: extend `Page` in `App.tsx`, add a `case` in `renderPage()`, and update `LinkProps['to']` in `Link.tsx`.
- **No login/auth UI** unless explicitly requested — use “Trở về trang chủ” (`to="/"`) on standalone flows like AI Coach instead of dashboard/profile sidebars.

## State and hooks

- `useState` for local UI (inputs, modals, step index).
- `useNavigation()` for cross-page navigation.
- Extract `useChat`, `useBookingSteps`, etc. when logic exceeds ~40 lines or is shared across pages.
- Prefer controlled inputs: `value` + `onChange` on chat/booking fields.

## Styling

- **Tailwind utilities** first; match tokens in `frontend/src/styles/theme.css` (`--primary`, `--background`, etc.).
- Brand green: `bg-[#0F6B3E]`, `hover:bg-[#0F6B3E]/90`, `text-[#0F6B3E]`, `border-[#0F6B3E]/30` — not `green-500`.
- Motion: `transition-all duration-300`, hover `hover:scale-105` on buttons/cards (containers only, not text).
- Sections: `py-24 px-6` with inner `max-w-7xl mx-auto`.
- Vietnamese copy: all user-facing strings in Vietnamese; use `leading-relaxed` (line-height ≥ 1.5); never `uppercase` on Vietnamese text; body text ≥ `text-sm` (14px).

## Images

- Use `ImageWithFallback` from `components/figma/ImageWithFallback.tsx` for logos and photos.
- Hero imagery: dark gradient overlay for legibility (`from-black/80` → `to-[#0B0B0B]`).

## Accessibility

- Visible focus: `focus:outline-none focus:border-[#0F6B3E]` or `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#0F6B3E]`.
- Meaningful `alt` on images (Vietnamese).
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for large animations when adding motion libraries.
